    silm:hasLongDescription "The GraniteStorageManifestSubcategory is the manifest/storage subcategory: chunk manifests (c-0x7f4a, c-0x3b1c, c-0x8e2d), versioned snapshots, content-addressed records — all storage-layer Icechunk artifacts. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'M_Granite', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .

